<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!-- Workbench icons (#1993, design system #1827): 24-unit grid, 1.5 stroke,
         square caps, miter joins, outline only, outlined to fill paths so PathIcon
         can draw them. Each starts with a zero-length frame at (0,0) and (24,24):
         PathIcon stretches a geometry to its own bounds, and the frame makes those
         bounds the full grid, so every icon keeps the same optical size. Icons with
         a Workbench name use that icon's published `filled` path; the rest were drawn
         to the same rules (scratch outliner: SkiaSharp stroke -> fill path). -->
